---
import { withBase } from "../lib/urls";
import BlogLayout from "../layouts/BlogLayout.astro";
import { personalInfo } from "../config";
---
<BlogLayout title="About" :heroTitle="`Hello, I\'m ${personalInfo.name}`" heroSubtitle="An ordinary person who loves coding and lives seriously.">
  <section class="card page-card about-card">
    <div class="about-intro"><img src={personalInfo.avatar} width="90" height="90" alt=`${personalInfo.name}` /><div><span class="eyebrow">HELLO, I'M {personalInfo.name}</span><h2>Glad to meet you <span class="accent">✿</span></h2><p>Full-Stack engineer / Lifelong learner / Daily recorder</p></div></div>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>About me</h2>
      <p>Hello, I'm {personalInfo.name}, I like turning ideas into usable things, and I also enjoy slowly figuring out 'why' through the process of tinkering.</p>
      <p>This is my personal blog, sharing front-end development, tool practice, and some life records. I don't aim for every article to cover everything; I just hope to authentically capture the process of thinking and growth.</p>
      <blockquote><p>Stay curious and live seriously. Do something you enjoy, and share your likes with others.</p></blockquote>
      <h2>What is he fussing?</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="interest-grid"><div><span class="icon-[lucide--code-xml]" aria-hidden="true"></span><strong>Write a bit of code</strong><p>Astro、Vue、TypeScript<br />Turn inspiration into small works</p></div><div><span class="icon-[lucide--coffee]" aria-hidden="true"></span><strong>Live a little life</strong><p>Music, walks, rambling<br />Collecting the light in ordinary days</p></div></div>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>About Kanade</h2>
      <p>Kanade, a small site that records what you love. The name comes from the pronunciation of 'Kanade', hoping that words and code can form their own melody like musical notes.</p>
      <p>The site is built using Astro, Vue and TailwindCSS. Pink, rounded corners, gently flowing waves are a touch of tenderness for every visitor.</p>
      <h2>About the content here</h2>
      <p>The current article is used as example. Later on, these will gradually be replaced with real study notes and daily records. If there are any omissions in the article, feel free to discuss via GitHub.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-links"><a class="btn" href={personalInfo.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="icon-[jam--github]" aria-hidden="true"></span>GitHub</a><a class="btn secondary" href={withBase("/posts/")}>Read my article<span class="icon-[lucide--arrow-right]" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></div>
    <div class="about-end">Thank you, I found this somewhere in the corner of the internet<span>✿</span></div>
  </section>
</BlogLayout>
<style>
.about-intro { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 22px; }
.about-intro img { border-radius: 26px; transform: rotate(-4deg); box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 var(--accent-soft); }
.about-intro .eyebrow { font-size: 9px; }
.about-intro h2 { font-size: 23px; margin: 7px 0; }
.about-intro p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 11px; margin: 0; }
.interest-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 15px; }
.interest-grid > div { border-radius: 12px; background: var(--accent-soft); padding: 20px; }
.interest-grid span { color: var(--accent); font-size: 25px; display: block; margin-bottom: 13px; }
.interest-grid strong { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; }
.interest-grid p { font-size: 11px; line-height: 2; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 0; }
.about-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin: 25px 0; font-size: 12px; }
.about-end { text-align: center; border-top: 1px dashed var(--line); margin-top: 32px; padding-top: 25px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 11px; }
.about-end span { display:block; font-size: 22px; color: var(--accent); margin-top: 10px; }
@media(max-width:480px) { .about-intro { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; } .about-intro h2 { font-size: 21px; } .interest-grid { gap: 10px; } .interest-grid > div { padding: 15px; } }
</style>
